TI  - ALKALINE PRETREATMENT AND AIR MIXING FOR IMPROVEMENT OF METHANE PRODUCTION FROM ANAEROBIC CO-DIGESTION OF POULTRY LITTER WITH WHEAT STRAW
AU  - ZHAN, Yuanhang
AU  - ZHU, Jun
AU  - XIAO, Yiting
AU  - SCHRADER, Leland C.
