TI  - Microaeration of Upflow Anaerobic Sludge Blanket reactor using desorption chamber gas: methane recovery and H2S removal
AU  - Mota, Daniel Carvalho
AU  - Batista, Isabela Ferreira
AU  - Souza, Cláudio Leite de
PY  - 2026
JO  - Engenharia Sanitaria e Ambiental
