TI  - Enhanced volatile fatty acids production from Napier grass(Pennisetum purpureum) using micro-aerated anaerobic culture
AU  - Chayanon Sawatdeenarunat
AU  - Rotjapun Nirunsin
AU  - Sumate S. Chaiprapat
PY  - 2021
JO  - DOAJ (DOAJ: Directory of Open Access Journals)
