TI  - Use of nanobubble water bioaugmented anaerobically digested sludge for high-efficacy energy production from high-solids anaerobic digestion of corn straw
AU  - Wang, Xuezhi
AU  - Lei, Zhongfang
AU  - Zhang, Zhenya
